- discarded thinking: 278,528 generated tokens (278,506 thinking tokens by our tokenizer); generation FLOPs 14.0% of CLM's executed FLOPs;
- the next reply also cut: 13 of 68;
- similarity of the first 200 thinking tokens with the next reply's (difflib ratio): median 0.47; >= 0.9: 0, >= 0.8: 1, >= 0.5: 30, < 0.3: 25; identical first 200 tokens: 0; median common prefix 0 tokens;
- baseline, a random reply of the same run more than 2 calls away: median 0.36; >= 0.8: 1, >= 0.5: 18; replies whose next reply beats the baseline by 0.2+: 15;
- upper bound for "resume, don't retry" (the cut thinking of replies whose next reply restarts similarly, ratio >= 0.8): 1 replies, 4,096 tokens, 0.2% of CLM's executed FLOPs.
- upper bound for "resume, don't retry" (the cut thinking of replies whose next reply restarts similarly, ratio >= 0.5): 30 replies, 122,880 tokens, 6.1% of CLM's executed FLOPs.

